      "review_status": "needs_review",
      "review_notes": "Split from residual-risk calculation because this card has an independent assessment/remediation objective: assess controls against design and operational effectiveness, then remediate gaps or failures. Design effectiveness, operational effectiveness, and sufficient operating period are parallel assessment standards connected by USES edges from the assessment action; no PRECEDES edge orders those dimensions. Functional-dependency PRECEDES edges from assessment to design-gap and operational-failure decisions represent condition dependencies reconstructed from the assessment standards and the subsequent if-statements. The remediation branches are kept inside this card because redesign, QC redesign, root-cause correction, and training are corrective responses to the same control-effectiveness assessment rather than standalone section-local processes."
